      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1915-04-24_WidnesExaminer_art0134" n="art0134">
        <head>coprzE ENCE</head>
        <p>coprzE ENCE</p>
        <p>The coffee Maid, of Syniington's, says: "MY way of making delicious coffee is the</p>
        <p>Symington way. A teaspoonful in a cup of boiling water, there you are." THOS. SY:IINGTON &amp; CO., Edinburik and Loudon.</p>
